&HEAD CHID='geom_frozen_gas_unfreeze', TITLE='GEOM box in a warm block, gas phase frozen until UNFREEZE_TIME' /

Two meshes split through the box, one process each. The gas phase is frozen until UNFREEZE_TIME: only the solid
phase is updated, and the divergence must keep the value computed at the start. After UNFREEZE_TIME the warm gas
rises around the box, and the divergence stays small and finite.

&MESH IJK=8,16,16, XB=0.0,0.5,0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0 /
&MESH IJK=8,16,16, XB=0.5,1.0,0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0 /

&TIME T_END=1.0, DT=0.002 /
&MISC UNFREEZE_TIME=0.5 /
&RADI RADIATION=F /

&INIT XB=0.2,0.8,0.2,0.8,0.2,0.8, TEMPERATURE=100. /

&GEOM ID='box', SURF_ID='INERT', XB=0.33,0.67,0.33,0.67,0.33,0.67 /

&VENT MB='ZMAX', SURF_ID='OPEN' /

&DEVC XB=0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0, QUANTITY='DIVERGENCE', SPATIAL_STATISTIC='MAX', ID='div_max' /
&DEVC XB=0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0,0.0,1.0, QUANTITY='DIVERGENCE', SPATIAL_STATISTIC='MIN', ID='div_min' /
&DEVC XYZ=0.5,0.5,0.75, QUANTITY='TEMPERATURE', ID='T_above' /
&DEVC XYZ=0.5,0.5,0.85, QUANTITY='W-VELOCITY', ID='w_above' /

&DUMP DT_DEVC=0.01 /

&TAIL /
